plicates of the same gene from multiple probes..\n\n\ncolnames(annot)[1] <- \"probe\"\nmerged <- merge(results, annot, by = \"probe\", all.x = TRUE)\nannotated <- merged[!is.na(merged$symbol) & merged$symbol != \"\", ]\nsig <- annotated[annotated$adj.P.Val < 0.05, ]\nsig$direction <- ifelse(sig$logFC > 0, \"up\", \"down\")\nsig <- sig[order(sig$adj.P.Val), ]\nbest <- sig[!duplicated(sig$symbol), ]\nrownames(best) <- NULL\n\nnrow(merged); nrow(annotated); nrow(sig); nrow(best)\nbest\ntable(best$direction)\n\n\nOutput:\n10\n8\n6\n5\nA data.frame: 5 × 6\nprobe\nlogFC\nP.Value\nadj.P.Val\nsymbol\ndirection\n<chr>\n<dbl>\n<dbl>\n<dbl>\n<chr>\n<chr>\n1004_at\n-1.39\n1e-12\n2.0e-09\nSERPINA3\ndown\n1005_at\n1.01\n9e-10\n8.0e-07\nFRZB\nup\n1001_at\n2.10\n2e-09\n1.0e-06\nNPPA\nup\n1003_at\n-1.35\n6e-06\n4.0e-04\nMYH6\ndown\n1010_at\n-0.70\n5e-04\n1.2e-02\nCORIN\ndown\n\nDown up\n3 2\n\nInspect the current document through CoCalc live document APIs before editing.\n\nThe document is file `/home/user/39_Coding_with_AI-I/In-Class_CodingWithAI_I.ipynb`.\n\nThe user's current selection is:\n\n```R\ncolnames(annot)[1] <- \"probe\"\nmerged <- merge(results, annot, by = \"probe\", all.x = TRUE)\nannotated <- merged[!is.na(merged$symbol) & merged$symbol != \"\", ]\nsig <- annotated[annotated$adj.P.Val < 0.05, ]\nsig$direction <- ifelse(sig$logFC > 0, \"up\", \"down\")\nsig <- sig[order(sig$adj.P.Val), ]\nbest <- sig[!duplicated(sig$symbol), ]\nrownames(best) <- NULL\n\nnrow(merged); nrow(annotated); nrow(sig); nrow(best)\nbest\ntable(best$direction)\n```\n\nTreat the live in-memory sync state as authoritative whenever it is available.\n\nDo not assume the filesystem copy is current.\n\nUse the metadata below only to locate the target, not as a substitute for reading live content.\n\n```json\n\n{\n  \"source\": \"editor-assistant\",\n  \"frame_type\": \"jupyter_cell_notebook\",\n  \"path\": \"/home/user/39_Coding_with_AI-I/In-Class_CodingWithAI_I.ipynb\",\n  \"language\": \"R\",\n  \"